<title>UK: GECC sets NZ$100 million 2-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets NZ$100 million 2-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    28.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.05    PAY DATE    28.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIP     0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
